.git
**/.vs
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
publish
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
platform/apps/*/dist
platform/apps/server/wwwroot
platform/apps/companion/src-tauri/target
# Local server data holds the admin's password hash and session and device credential
# hashes. Git ignores it; keep it out of every image and build cache too. Database:Path can
# name any file, so every SQLite name .gitignore covers is excluded, with its journal, WAL and
# shared-memory sidecars (<name>-journal, -wal, -shm).
platform/apps/server/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*